  "title": "Steven M NDE 7386",
  "date": "Spring 1965",
  "content": "At the time my air way was being blocked off by a much larger boy who was at the school bus stop. He responded to me making fun about him with the other kids. He pushed me up against a tree and as I blacked out, I felt myself sliding down the face of the tree. The next thing I knew I was looking down on this whole scene. I saw myself and the girls that were pulling him off me. This looking down scene lasted no more than 3 seconds. But during that time, I do recall having 360 degree vision. I recall coming back to consciousness and gasping for air. My throat hurt for several hours at school that day. Then the whole thing was forgotten about until almost 20 years ago when I read about someone's NDE.",
